WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:02.650
My Dear Brother...

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:04.650
Kaoru-no-Kimi is leaving the hospital today.

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:14.130
Though it was only overnight, and a simple basketball injury,

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.330
It is STILL a special occasion.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.670
What's taking so long?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.870
In attendance are Mariko-san and I.

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:25.270
Saint-Juste-sama is not present.

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:27.140
There she is!

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:37.420
Here!

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:41.160
Congratulations on your discharge!

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:43.830
Oh! You came to see me...?

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:45.760
Hi!

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.830
Congratulations on your discharge!

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.160
Thank-you.

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:51.630
But isn't this a bit much?

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:53.640
I was only in the hospital for observation.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.440
But I couldn't sleep all night for worrying!

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:58.840
Ah... oh...

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:04.650
Oh I see! My worrying isn't important enough to concern you!

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:06.450
That's not true!

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.650
Oh, these are some of my favorite flowers!

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:12.390
Thank-you... Mariko-san.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:16.530
You made me so happy!

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:18.460
So happy!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.530
SO HAPPY!

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:24.200
That's the first time you used my first name!

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.610
My dear Brother...

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:35.080
Look at Mariko-san!

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:42.480
<b>17. Post Scriptum</b>

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:54.100
So she's already out of the hospital? Thank goodness!

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:55.700
I'm glad it wasn't serious.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:59.640
Yes, and starting tomorrow she can even exercise a little.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:04.640
But what a surprise! The way Mariko-san adores Kaoru-no-Kimi!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.580
I had no idea!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:07.640
Neither did I! <b> </b>

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.980
Neither did I! Really?

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:10.380
That's the truth!

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:14.520
That's true, my dear Brother.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:21.190
I don't know when Mariko began to adore Kaoru-no-Kimi...

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:25.860
But this is love. Real love.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:33.140
She's so honest and direct with her feelings!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.670
Mariko-san just can't lie to herself.

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:40.610
It makes sense, you know... <b> </b>

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:41.540
It makes sense, you know... What?

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:46.480
Kaoru-no-Kimi is more manly than the pathetic boys around here...

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:47.550
...and so good-looking!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:51.750
And that way she talks: effervescent, like fresh soda!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.220
So Mariko-san got to her first! <b> </b>

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:54.360
So Mariko-san got to her first! What?

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:56.430
It was Mariko-san who got her... <b> </b>

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:57.560
It was Mariko-san who got her... Tomoko!

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.160
I'm kidding! Let's just say I'm kidding.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:14.040
I felt envious of her, my Brother...

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.910
Mariko-san is so direct...

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:24.320
I've come to like Mariko-san very much.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:42.740
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.420
Nanako-san!

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:04.430
Your father wants to talk to you!

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:07.300
OK! I'm coming!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.500
OK!

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:11.370
OK!

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:16.310
My dear Brother, when I compare myself to Mariko,

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:19.240
I just can't be as frank as she is.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.140
I'm still sore.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:11.360
Get in. I'll take you to school.

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:19.230
You played in the basketball game...?

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:20.770
Yes.

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.170
So, what should I think of all this...?

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:25.970
What?

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.240
Did you enjoy it?

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.050
Uhh...

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:35.720
I'd really like to know, so I'll ask you again...

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:39.520
Well, yes. I did.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:40.990
Is that so?

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:43.730
Is it?

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:45.990
Is it?

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:50.800
Let me ask you once again.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.000
Did you enjoy it?

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:59.610
No. They made me play. I had to.

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:04.150
Oh? That's better, then.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.750
Please let go of me.

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:11.690
You must never forget...

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:15.960
...that there is no one who understands you better than I do.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:17.430
Am I right?

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.090
Yes.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:40.180
Good morning!

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:40.650
Good morning! Good morning!

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:40.980
Good morning! <b> </b>

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:41.450
Good morning! Good morning!

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:42.050
Good morning!

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:06.740
That's right. They only affect you. No one else.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:11.550
But think of yourself for once. And you'll see you shouldn't.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:14.280
What did Miya-sama say?

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:17.620
You came here together, right? I saw you getting out of her car.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:23.490
Hand them over!

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:26.760
Do it! Hand them over!

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:40.040
You know, that basketball game...

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:41.980
...I had a great time!

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:46.780
You make me proud, Rei!

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:05.000
Kaoru-no-Kimi... ...won't you have lunch with us?

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:10.270
I'm sorry... I really should check in with the Coach first...

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:14.080
Besides, we need to go over the schedule for the city tournaments...

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:22.950
Come on, let's go... <b> </b>

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:23.950
Come on, let's go... Ummm...

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.020
Hmm? Something wrong?

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:27.560
Uh... no.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:36.630
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:51.250
She's as popular as ever!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.720
It happened suddenly, my Brother...

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.790
My heart began to race.

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:02.460
I felt flushed and hot.

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:05.530
Though I wasn't sad...

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:07.260
...there seemed to be tears in my eyes.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.000
Nanako-san!

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:17.810
Let's hurry! Tomoko might be looking for us.

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:18.740
OK.

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:22.340
Mix lightly, put it into a lightly buttered and powdered pan...

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:26.350
...then put it into the oven at 180, wait for fifteen minutes...

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.820
...and it will turn light brown. Then it's done.

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:33.220
Since you're asking me all this, are you planning on baking something?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.290
Yes... I'm planning on it...

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.020
Mmm, mmm! <b> </b>

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:38.560
Mmm, mmm! Heartwarming, homemade cookies..!

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.500
Someone would love getting cookies, don't you think?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.630
Uh-huh... <b> </b>

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.970
Uh-huh... I wish I could just give her my soul!

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.630
Oh, Whatever you say!

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:48.100
Oh! Um... I just remembered...

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:53.110
I have an errand to run... at the student store...

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:54.640
Excuse me!

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.380
What's with her? <b> </b>

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:57.450
What's with her? No idea...

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.720
I'm sorry. We just sold our last stamp.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.120
Oh. I see.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.470
Oh! Look at these flowers!

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:28.680
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:04.050
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:45.420
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:50.030
What is she thinking? What is she feeling?

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:51.030
What...?

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.900
She's all alone in the gym, in the early afternoon...

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.900
...it can only be that she is love-sick for someone...

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:58.570
Um...

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:00.640
Who is it?

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.770
Upsetting a pretty girl like this...

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.310
Orihara Kaoru should be ashamed of herself!

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.050
It's not like that! That's not it at all!

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:14.580
That's not it!

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:30.670
No...

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:55.420
For goodness sake...

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:59.160
Kaoru-no-Kimi is for Mariko-san.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.100
Geez...!

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:31.730
My Brother...

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:37.000
I have misplaced a very important letter to you!

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:45.210
[...written in plain English, the book is suitable for beginners.]

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.480
That's how it goes.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.680
Kusunoki-sensei, I have a question.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.680
Yes, Miss Shinobu, go ahead.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:54.220
If one omitted the word <i>"being"</i>,

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:58.620
...would the adverb clause go from passive voice to active voice?

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:01.560
That's a good question, Miss Shinobu!

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.830
Look how alive Mariko-san is!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.830
She is overflowing with self-confidence,

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.830
...and seems so much more positive than before.

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:13.640
Her beauty has even become more refined...

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:17.710
...and Love has given her a new allure...

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.910
But unlike Mariko-san...

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.780
...I just feel confused, my Brother...

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:28.190
Bringing it to school was a mistake...

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:31.700
I could have bought a stamp near home.

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:35.840
Anyway, at the next break I'll take care of it...

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:43.660
Hurry up, bell!

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:55.660
Nanako-san!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.370
Where did I lose it?

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:10.670
Nanako-san!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:17.860
A lost letter? Nobody's brought one to the student office.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.320
What's the matter?

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:25.730
What happened?

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:28.420
What? A letter?

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.850
I was going to mail it at lunch time.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:33.450
What'll I do now?

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:39.270
Don't tell me... ...don't tell me it's a letter to a BOY!

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:42.350
Nanako-san! Is that it?

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.130
A boy?

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:45.860
A letter? <b> </b>

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:46.930
A letter? What's it about?

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:48.550
Come here...

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:53.650
I forbid it! You cannot date a boy!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:55.520
It... it's not like that!

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.800
You mustn't! No way! Absolutely not!

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.340
You just don't know how men are!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:05.640
They're dirty, disgusting, shameless, selfish, and abusive!

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:07.170
Mariko-san!

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:10.720
If they look gentle it's a only a front!

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.200
Only an illusion!

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:16.200
So, don't! Don't date any men! I forbid it!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:17.450
Mariko-san...

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:21.060
Don't! Don't do it! Don't! Don't!

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:25.530
Mariko-san...

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:36.450
So, let's go. 6th period is starting.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:40.460
I'll give up looking for my letter.

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:43.480
I'll give up on it. That's what I told myself.

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:46.970
But I don't like the thought that someone might find it,

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:48.980
...and peek into our relationship.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.210
...but it shouldn't cause any problem.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:55.830
There wasn't anything I wrote that would cause a problem for you...

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.040
...I thought.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.040
Misonoo-san...?

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:07.510
Yes? Mona-Lisa-sama? Borgia-sama?

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:19.650
Fukiko-sama has something important to discuss with you.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.660
With... with me?

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:24.580
Yes, Misonoo-san, with you.

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:30.650
Come to her house after school.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:33.690
What's this about?

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:36.290
I'm sure you know already.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:37.540
What?

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:43.420
Miya-sama likes you, so don't make trouble for her...

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:46.600
You understand?

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:48.810
I think we made ourselves clear.

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:56.250
Did you do something to upset Miya-sama?

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.520
No.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.070
What if...!

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:29.830
I was hoping my premonition would not be true...

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:55.990
How was that? That serenade was for you.

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:58.480
What? For me?

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:01.720
It was wonderful! Thank-you very much!

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:04.720
I'm glad it appealed to you.

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:11.850
Would you be so kind as to make tea for me too?

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:13.190
Yes, I will!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.020
I don't take sugar, please...

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:24.150
Yes, OK.

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:25.740
Here, please...

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:27.530
Thank you.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.200
Henmi Takehiko...

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:41.830
Pardon me, but I saw to whom it was addressed.

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:50.980
I'm sorry! Excuse me!

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:54.930
But, thank goodness, it was a Sorority member who found it.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:21:59.390
If it had been found by someone else,

00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:01.870
...it would have started rumors.

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:04.950
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:08.290
You're nothing but apologies...!

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:10.210
I'm sorry.

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:12.830
Didn't I ask you...

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:15.780
...not to date any boys...?

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:17.520
...isn't that right?

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:20.650
But he's a pen-pal! Just a pen-pal!

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:27.070
Today, perhaps that is so...

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:30.790
...but how can you guarantee that a romance won't follow?

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:46.310
I like your gentle nature...

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:51.380
...and how obedient and submissive you are.

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:53.660
Now... tear it up. <b> </b>

00:22:53.660 --> 00:22:54.470
Now... tear it up. What?

00:22:54.980 --> 00:22:56.450
Right in front of me.

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:00.110
Go ahead.

00:23:02.910 --> 00:23:04.380
My Brother...!

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:10.410
I'm kidding...!

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:14.500
I'm sorry. I just wanted to tease you.

00:23:17.400 --> 00:23:18.480
Brother...

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:24.720
My dear Brother...

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:28.070
I'm going to drop this in a mailbox right now.

00:23:28.850 --> 00:23:30.930
My heart travels along with this letter,

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:36.930
...so please read this a bit more carefully than past letters.

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:40.880
This is the letter that was lost.

00:23:41.740 --> 00:23:46.830
P.S. -- from she whose heart beats faster around a certain someone,

00:23:46.830 --> 00:23:50.510
...and from the one who has been a little strange lately...

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:01.880 --> 00:25:04.290
--Preview--

00:25:04.290 --> 00:25:08.980
Nanako and Saint-Juste skip class and go to the park,

00:25:08.980 --> 00:25:11.730
...where they encounter Henmi and Takashi.

00:25:12.190 --> 00:25:15.210
Saint-Juste calls Takashi her "brother"...

00:25:15.850 --> 00:25:20.610
Nanako - finally - confesses her feelings to Saint-Juste.

00:25:21.110 --> 00:25:22.180
Next episode: <b> </b>

00:25:22.180 --> 00:25:23.790
Next episode: <b>Into the Dream...</b>

00:25:23.960 --> 00:25:25.500
Brother, Dear Brother... <b> </b>

00:25:25.510 --> 00:25:29.390
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
